  <biography>k__BackingField: "The firstborn daughter of the Bloodrose family. After
    her father\u2019s death, she took over the family business. However, she never
    married, and the Bloodrose line ended with her."
  <souvenirData>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9445aa4f19727c1499a6df95d5250517, type: 2}
  <souvenirNote>k__BackingField: "\u201CYou once said the night would never end.\nBut
    you were wrong - \nIt ends the moment someone dares to light a candle.\n\nYou
    were my light.\u201D\n\nThere is also short note on the back:\n\n\u201CLove ~\nEven
    when the world forbiddeth it.\nFor love alone is the law worth breaking.\u201D\n"
